# dist-relative paths that scripts/build-vercel-output.mjs leaves out of the
# uploaded Build Output. This is our own file — Vercel's vercel.json schema
# rejects unknown keys, so the list cannot live there.
#
# `zk/account` is the account-custody proving key tree (~21 MB). It is only
# fetched when a Passport deploys its own account contract, which a public
# deployment does not do, so shipping it would be weight that cannot be used.
# `/zk/midnames` IS shipped: that is the .night-registration circuit the
# preview network uses.

zk/account

# Self-ignoring marker written into public/zk-params by fetch-zk-params.mjs.
zk-params/.gitignore
